## 2. Derived data — not covered by the MIT grant

The tables in 01_data/processed/ are computed from a third-party public Steam
dataset (a Kaggle scrape of the Steam store, ~2025-03-10). They are included
here so that every result and every test in this repository can be reproduced
without redistributing the 436 MB raw scrape.

These derived tables are **not** relicensed by the MIT grant above. If you
intend to redistribute them or use them commercially, check the terms of the
upstream dataset first.

